   ],
   "created_in": "SUM002-3",
   "annotated_by": "P03",
   "value": {
    "ja": "単価でみたい。というか、どれくらいの物理的規模感のものが、いくらなのか、みてみたい。貴重感というか高級感というか。",
    "en": "I want to see it by unit price. Or rather, I want to know what kind of physical quantity this actually was and how much it cost. Like how rare or luxurious it was."
   },
   "annotation_timing": "in_session",
   "annotated_on": [
    "PAG0082"
   ],
